{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_1000_p", "source_sha256": "23728a114e1ffd19ff58183ccd503f41fff8fc30f484e4d8c9322ea817bdec12", "ja": "（可奈がチョコブランドのアンバサダーに選ばれた！\nチョコのお渡し会も大盛況だったな）", "zh": "（可奈被选为巧克力品牌的大使！巧克力赠送会也大获成功）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "fb401031f22f242349b563ee8cda92e8d9ffd8919fd3429e9180c82ae42254e9", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\n今日はお疲れさまでした！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n今天辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_1002_p", "source_sha256": "618a0d5709dedc4319cf928f0980ab96c75df8fa924fd72993151c6405d5a814", "ja": "可奈こそ、お疲れさま。\nブランドの担当者さん、喜んでくれてたぞ！", "zh": "可奈才是，辛苦了。\n品牌负责人很开心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "d8436d34b1722f1e27785faff935bfa583db426a3d4022262bd7819f0f7b2b6f", "ja": "えへへ♪　うまく出来てよかったです！\n{$P$}さんのおかげですね♪", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 能顺利完成真是太好了！\n\n多亏了{$P$}先生呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_1004_p", "source_sha256": "69252b55a3a531ee04287aec5bee4c0a57ab80b24a2fd5f4c2ece406999894e9", "ja": "いや、俺はなにもしてないって。\nおかげって言うなら、可奈のおかげだよ。", "zh": "不是，我什么都没做。\n要说多亏了谁，那也是多亏了可奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "6f82f66325b4a529b2874f654d26281ba801d7b611cf816ba6a608ef39bde421", "ja": "そんなことないです！　あの……。\nカフェに寄った時のこと、覚えてますか？", "zh": "不是这样的！那个……\n还记得我们去咖啡馆时的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c6f275fb8e604e1c27b336440d52c106268925cfa2e3ed6d8723f469e41f38af", "ja": "カフェ……ああ、パフェ食べた時の？", "zh": "咖啡馆……啊，你是说吃芭菲的那次？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "f38266f732acf3c4a3ad0034deaa05f44a6678234a9bbacaecc5b75f8111cf41", "ja": "それです！　あの時、すごくおいしくて～……♪\nじゃなくて！　えっと……えへっ。", "zh": "就是那个！那时候特别好吃～……♪\n不对！那个……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "7cd563963bdf79aa2ef6897d290e6758467a957bd40f52ee032269dd032dfe74", "ja": "{$P$}さん、私に食べさせて\nくれましたよね？　あれが、すっごく嬉しくて♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生当时喂给我\n吃了对吧？那时我真的超级开心的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "dfc4a759e1424756385a2d353405861e41695dd0b00fc3f3a7d693aed9d268ee", "ja": "だから今日のお渡し会も、\nああいう気持ちを届けられたら、って思ったんです！", "zh": "所以我就想，今天的赠送会也能把那样的心情传达给大家就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d61f0aeb16051e99fd9afae4a83f21991bd97e3cc0ed40201f54f8b754c6e70e", "ja": "なるほど。あの一口で……。\n寄り道した甲斐があったってわけだな。", "zh": "原来如此。就靠那一口……  \n看来这趟绕道是值得的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "fd6601ebf299e400ceaea061e76c7e36c959b8db910fa99432c96572524ee73e", "ja": "はい！　届けるぞ真心～♪　{$P$}\nさんには、あま～いチョコ～♪　……はっ！？", "zh": "好！把真心送给你～♪ 给{$P$}先生的是甜甜的巧克力～♪……啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "d6d6290b72b255806fcf638c131ad74402507d6862e6561ce89ab48cd97f368f", "ja": "わ、わ、私のばか～っ！？　サプライズに\nしたかったのに、先に歌っちゃった……。", "zh": "呜、呜、我这个笨蛋——！？本来想给你一个惊喜的，结果却先唱出来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "40ad239f923f31a9c55fead300a01e20687778a968d69765194d2fc9c914b515", "ja": "うぅ……というわけで……。", "zh": "呜呜……所以说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "e7c311fc4aabf1812b160f058df4e51e966866c190be4341cb0c69a57b6eb330", "ja": "{$P$}さんっ！\n私のチョコ、受け取ってください！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n请收下我的巧克力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_1015", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_2000_p", "source_sha256": "d8b1240205442d1ea523c4e86c95ddf85e3fbf3b955d8974b2bcb6143c631e2e", "ja": "おっ、ありがとう！\nもしかしてこれ、手作りなのか？", "zh": "哦，谢谢你！\n难道说，这是你亲手做的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_2001_036kan", "source_sha256": "575b5138f4d46709b098e64a74472bbad6b68ecb3bf23fcc5c5c13b6e9883c97", "ja": "はい、自信作なんです♪\nサプライズは失敗しちゃいましたけど……うぅ。", "zh": "是的，这是我的得意之作♪\n虽然惊喜没能成功……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_2002_p", "source_sha256": "ce0ebefcd66c8649acdee9999692654f0890f86e28594719b0009e8afa131a18", "ja": "いや、じゅうぶんビックリしたよ。\nありがとう、可奈。", "zh": "不，我已经非常惊讶了。\n谢谢你，可奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_2003_p", "source_sha256": "ee6a3ad28e69203a146eeb20a6b960187c810b924053d72ecad7799b7557d19c", "ja": "チョコと一緒に、歌まで歌ってくれたんだから。\n贅沢なバレンタインになったよ。", "zh": "你不仅送了巧克力，还为我唱了歌。\n真是个奢侈的情人节。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_2004_036kan", "source_sha256": "4279bbbf612e66fb29c5afff9c9fc1f642be03dad5743f0cde2ada7c2044003d", "ja": "よかったぁ、早起きしてつくったんです！\nそれに、歌まで喜んでもらえるなんて……ハッピー♪", "zh": "太好了，我特意早起做的！而且，连歌都能让你喜欢……好开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0234_2005_036kan", "source_sha256": "c3c82f6feabf8185c0babda6fe64f4295ca337ba8f993958fbab8ee822c103d0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、だいすき～♪\n伝わって、この気持ち～、えへっ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，最喜欢你啦～♪\n希望这份心意能传达给你～，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
